# Defensive: never commit secrets even if accidentally copied into the tree.
**/.ssh/
**/.gnupg/
**/.aws/
**/.1password/
**/1Password/
**/.claude.json
**/.docker/config.json
**/.ollama/
**/*_history
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*token*
**/*secret*
**/.dotfiles-backup/

# Sunshine: config is tracked, but runtime state holds a password hash,
# client pairing certs and the CA private key. Never commit these.
config/sunshine/credentials/
config/sunshine/sunshine_state.json
config/sunshine/sunshine.log
config/sunshine/*.pem
